      "id": "A-5:17:0",
      "sceneId": "A-5",
      "speaker": "戌（沈辞）",
      "mood": "",
      "direction": "",
      "expression": "surprised",
      "portraitExpression": "surprised",
      "displayedExpression": "surprised",
      "cg": null,
      "stage": "xu",
      "annotated": true,
      "text": "你也……送他们。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A-5:22:0",
      "sceneId": "A-5",
      "speaker": "屈衡",
      "mood": "",
      "direction": "屈衡卷起祭图，搁到旁边。图上那个小人被最后一层纸遮住。",
      "expression": "sad",
      "portraitExpression": "sad",
      "displayedExpression": "sad",
      "cg": null,
      "stage": "quheng",
      "annotated": true,
      "text": "给你一道命令，又装作给你一个父亲。是我的错。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A-6a:9:0",
      "sceneId": "A-6a",
      "speaker": "屈衡",
      "mood": "",
      "direction": "",
      "expression": "sad",
      "portraitExpression": "sad",
      "displayedExpression": "sad",
      "cg": null,
      "stage": "quheng",
      "annotated": true,
      "text": "总以为下一回能备得足些，寻个好领队，多添几袋粮，路就会不同。"
