      "sceneId": "终-3",
      "speaker": "宋嘉树",
      "mood": "没笑",
      "direction": "",
      "expression": "smile",
      "portraitExpression": "default",
      "displayedExpression": "default",
      "cg": null,
      "stage": "song",
      "annotated": false,
      "text": "刚才你一倒，我腿都软了。下回撑不住，先跟我说。我嘴欠，可不传话。"
    },
    {
      "id": "终-4:13:0",
      "sceneId": "终-4",
